    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 · Turning the store on\nTwo halves, and they run days apart.\n\n**Top:** the seller asks for a store → Stripe payment link → sent on WhatsApp.\n\n**Bottom:** Stripe calls back when the money actually lands → the store flips to `active` and both of you get told.\n\nNothing is activated on request alone — only a real payment flips it.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "note-2153",
      "name": "Note 2153",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Stripe setup\n1. Create a **recurring** price (29 AED / month) → put its id in `STRIPE_PRICE_ID`\n2. Stripe → Developers → Webhooks → add this workflow's `rentstore-stripe` URL\n3. Send `checkout.session.completed` and `invoice.paid`\n\nUsing Tap or Telr instead? Swap the one HTTP node and the event names — the shape of the flow doesn't change.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "note-1876",
      "name": "Note 1876",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        1000
      ]
    }
